WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.625
- Ja'Marr Chase, Jaylen Waddle, DeVonta Smith. I'll remember
everyone who's in front of me.

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:07.166
- Bro, we're in a line. It's the Quarter-Season Carnival.

00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:08.625
- Men, are you ready to play?!

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:10.375
- Uh, coach? That's the funnel cake stand.

00:00:10.375 --> 00:00:12.875
- Don't matter, everywhere I go I compete.

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:14.875
- I'll take the biggest prize ever.

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:18.291
- Uhh, looks like you haven't quite earned it yet. Gotta win a few more games.

00:00:18.291 --> 00:00:20.000
- Still? What about him?

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.875
- I haven't even won anything, but people keep giving me prizes!

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:29.750
- No Ball Pitts today. Maybe next week, maybe not. Go ahead, write our obituary. See if I care.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.791
- Guys, where are you going? It's all patched up. Good as new.

00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:35.500
- Try your hand at Trubi-skee ball!

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:36.625
- Are you gonna play?

00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:37.375
- A little.

00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:38.291
- My turn!

00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:39.500
- Why do you still have a baby voice?

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.500
- Last year didn't count.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:45.250
- Not yet.
- What? But that creep on the Browns gets rewarded?

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.291
- Hahahaha. Ahahahaha.

00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:48.375
- F--k that elf.

00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:49.875
- Just gotta hold 'em off now.

00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:52.875
- I'm Jalen Hurts. You can like me and still hate Philadelphia.

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:54.416
- Naaah, I need to see more.

00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:57.666
- This year there's a lot of pressure, but it's because everyone believes in me!

00:00:57.666 --> 00:00:59.791
- I can hang. Ah, where's our defense?

00:00:59.791 --> 00:01:01.375
What can I get for all these?

00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:03.875
- Something quite special.
[sad music]

00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:06.250
- They just never give us running backs what we deserve.

00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:10.541
-You wanna split one or do you want your own?

00:01:10.541 --> 00:01:12.875
-Ahahah, ahahaha.

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:14.791
-I don't know what that means but I love this kid's motor.

00:01:14.791 --> 00:01:19.000
-Hahahahaha.
-Oh, yeah, he's got that dog in him.

